    {
      "id": "37704310",
      "title": "Added Validation",
      "sourceHash": "dd290e6cabdc144b1b5fffcc33677228b68714d235130d08ba822719797be946",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 5.43,
          "en": "Okay, so this meetup REST API is taking shape",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.43,
          "end": 8.61,
          "en": "and we're almost ready, or I'm almost ready here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.61,
          "end": 11.61,
          "en": "to dive into these enhancements I mentioned before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.61,
          "end": 12.87,
          "en": "But before I do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.87,
          "end": 16.44,
          "en": "there's one missing feature, and that's validation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.44,
          "end": 19.44,
          "en": "The incoming data should be validated,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.44,
          "end": 23.1,
          "en": "so that an empty title, for example, can't be stored.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.1,
          "end": 25.44,
          "en": "And at the moment, that's not the case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.44,
          "end": 28.8,
          "en": "In my POST route, I'm just extracting the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.8,
          "end": 30.54,
          "en": "and then I'm storing it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.54,
          "end": 32.79,
          "en": "without checking whether it's correct.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.79,
          "end": 35.1,
          "en": "And the same happens here in the PATCH route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.1,
          "end": 37.02,
          "en": "which is used for updating.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.02,
          "end": 39.15,
          "en": "And in both routes, I wanna ensure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.15,
          "end": 41.73,
          "en": "that the incoming data is validated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.73,
          "end": 44.01,
          "en": "Therefore, it's time for another request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.01,
          "end": 47.1,
          "en": "or another message to ChatGPT.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.1,
          "end": 49.89,
          "en": "And here I'll simply say Update the code",
          "zh": ""
        },
